# 1. YOUR MISSION

Build a complete, modern, professional, completely free online PDF productivity platform.

This is not a request to produce a landing-page mockup, a static prototype, a collection of attractive but non-functional buttons, or a basic collection of conversion forms.

Build a complete working product.

The final application must combine:

- A premium, thoughtfully art-directed user interface.
- A distinctive and coherent visual identity.
- Sophisticated 3D visual experiences using Three.js where appropriate.
- A carefully selected ecosystem of UI and frontend libraries.
- An excellent responsive experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile.
- A comprehensive collection of functioning PDF tools.
- A professional PDF document editor.
- Advanced page, text, image, annotation, and object-management capabilities.
- Object visibility, hiding, restoration, and actual removal.
- Genuine PDF conversion, processing, and export.
- Secure document handling and privacy-conscious processing.
